  "queryImages": [],
  "deprecatedReference": false,
  "deprecatedMatches": {},
  "qid": "7",
  "tip": "<p>When you see very high request rates with a modest database connection limit, think in terms of <i>session pooling</i> with <i>multiplexing</i> and <i>dynamic</i> sizing. Estimate concurrent sessions rather than raw requests per second and remember that the Cloud SQL Auth Proxy does not pool connections.</p>",
